  doomgeneric and the id Software Doom source release. Licence: GNU GPL v2.0.
  Our changes are the files in doom-build/; see doom-build/README.txt for the exact build.
  Embeds the Doom shareware WAD v1.9 (DOOM1.WAD, md5 f0cefca49926d00903cf57551d901abe),
  which id Software allows to be freely distributed.

